data
  title Trace context: one pattern, four runtimes
  compares
    - label Node.js
      children
        - label Store: AsyncLocalStorage
        - label Hook: pino mixin reads active span
        - label Drops on: setTimeout, unbound Promises, worker threads
    - label Go
      children
        - label Store: explicit context.Context
        - label Hook: slog/zap reads ctx passed to handler
        - label Drops on: goroutine launched without parent ctx
    - label Python
      children
        - label Store: contextvars.ContextVar (3.7+)
        - label Hook: structlog merge_contextvars processor
        - label Drops on: threading.Thread, ProcessPoolExecutor
    - label JVM
      children
        - label Store: thread-local MDC / ThreadContext
        - label Hook: OTel Java agent auto-instruments
        - label Drops on: manual thread pools without context copy
